	(text "3V3_MCU: diode-OR of +5V and USB VBUS, so the MCU runs on USB alone\n(flashing without 24 V). VBUS feeds nothing else. 3V3_AUX: sensors, status LEDs.\nVREF_A = 3V3_MCU through 10R + 1uF + 100nF to AGND (ratiometric ADC)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 38.1 213.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "39a74e25-2a13-5a07-bb45-76ff2f35f6da")
	)
	(text "TPS54360B, 604 kHz (RT 160k), Vout = 0.8 x (1 + 36k/6.8k) = 5.04 V.\nUVLO 1M/68k: start 17.6 V, stop 14.3 V. Compensation 6.8k + 22nF // 100pF.\nCatch diode SS56C: non-synchronous buck. Values: docs/calculations.md §1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 38.1 139.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "c001cff2-7a3e-50a0-bf0b-fecb799adaee")
	)
